#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:5
#: da4512b8c2e84c1a81183c0ab71fdf4a
msgid "Traditional Helicopter – Swashplate Setup"
msgstr "传统直升机 – 斜盘设置"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:7
#: 504f643d2d5e4151a4d8549a892b393c
msgid ""
"The swashplate is designed to take the servo inputs that are based on the "
"pilot’s pitch, roll, and collective commands and translate them to "
"individual blade pitch inputs. There are many different servo arrangements "
"for both three and four servo swashplates. The swashplate library covers all"
" of the popular configurations for both three and four servo swashplates. If"
" you have a unique swashplate, you can also use the generic three servo "
"swashplate."
msgstr ""
"斜盘设计为接受基于飞手俯仰、横滚和总距指令的舵机输入，并将其转换为各桨叶的俯仰输入。三舵机和四舵机斜盘有许多不同的舵机布置方式。斜盘库涵盖了三舵机和四舵机斜盘的所有常见配置。如果您有独特的斜盘，也可以使用通用三舵机斜盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:14
#: 278f6c11216e4d16aa7268c0abbd5d66
msgid ""
"Linearize Servo is a feature that you can use for both three and four servo "
"swashplates. However, it is optional for the three servo swashplates as "
"there is no chance for binding. It will most likely always be required for "
"four servo swashplates because of the potential for binding in a four point "
"attachment."
msgstr ""
"线性化舵机是一个可用于三舵机和四舵机斜盘的功能。但对于三舵机斜盘是可选的，因为没有卡滞的风险。对于四舵机斜盘，由于四点连接可能存在卡滞，很可能始终需要此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:19
#: cd507aa6b7be45c0bc00e63269945517
msgid ""
"The following video covers the swashplate setup and leveling the swashplate."
msgstr "以下视频涵盖了斜盘设置和斜盘调平。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:23
#: 13904207fa0f40f3b1e535e5bf2a6ad5
msgid ""
"This video covers setting up the min collective, max collective, zero thrust"
" collective, max cyclic and stabilize collective curve."
msgstr "此视频介绍了最小总距、最大总距、零推力总距、最大周期和 Stabilize 总距曲线的设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:28
#: ec2063d72c304038bdab4be65c5bd17a
msgid "Before You Begin"
msgstr "开始之前"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:30
#: 4c2aa79863954677ab806a136b51b231
msgid ""
"Prior to beginning the swashplate set up, be sure that your helicopter "
"control linkages are set up in accordance with the assembly instructions. In"
" order to make accurate blade pitch measurements, make the rotor shaft "
"perpendicular to the ground by using shims underneath the landing gear as "
"shown in the picture below."
msgstr ""
"在开始斜盘设置之前，请确保您的直升机控制连杆按照装配说明进行设置。为了进行准确的桨叶俯仰测量，通过在起落架下方放置垫片使旋翼轴垂直于地面，如下图所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:38
#: 1b4eb44d0f0e46a8bee03ef7cca01acd
msgid ""
"Lastly, it is possible if you haven’t adjusted your tail rotor linkage, or "
"your throttle linkage in the case of a gas engine, you could have binding "
"occur while doing the swashplate set up. This is due to the :ref:`H_SV_MAN "
"<H_SV_MAN>` feature providing manual servo settings that drive the servos to"
" the min and max values. This includes the tail rotor servo and the throttle"
" servo due to throttle curve settings."
msgstr ""
"最后，如果您没有调整尾旋翼连杆，或者对于汽油发动机没有调整油门连杆，在进行斜盘设置时可能会发生卡滞。这是因为 :ref:`H_SV_MAN "
"<H_SV_MAN>` 功能提供手动舵机设置，将舵机驱动到最小和最大值。这包括尾旋翼舵机和由于油门曲线设置导致的油门舵机。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:45
#: d64cdaf8c5214d76ba8c0d9a3678c568
msgid "Select Swashplate Type"
msgstr "选择斜盘类型"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:47
#: 8314a5fb8f294f328b532942bdaa358f
msgid ""
"Below are the swashplate type selections using the "
":ref:`H_SW_TYPE<H_SW_TYPE__AP_MotorsHeli_Single>` parameter.  The diagrams "
"shown label the servo attach positions as Servo 1, Servo 2 and Servo 3 for "
"the three servo swashplate types.  These also correspond to the default "
"output functions for servo outputs 1 thru 3 on the autopilot for the servos "
"used with these swashplate types."
msgstr ""
"以下是使用 :ref:`H_SW_TYPE<H_SW_TYPE__AP_MotorsHeli_Single>` "
"参数的斜盘类型选择。所示图表将三舵机斜盘类型的舵机连接位置标记为舵机 1、舵机 2 和舵机 "
"3。这些也对应于飞控上用于这些斜盘类型的舵机的默认输出功能（舵机输出 1 至 3）。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:50
#: bc91ff7ff6f343e68742aa4eb964fa23
msgid ""
"For single heli, the servo function assigned to Servo 1 is motor 33, Servo 2"
" is motor 34, and Servo 3 is motor 35.  These assignments are the same for "
"swashplate 1 for a dual heli frame.  Swashplate 2 for a dual heli defaults "
"to servo outputs 4, 5, and 6 with motors 36, 37 and 38 assigned "
"respectively."
msgstr ""
"对于单旋翼直升机，分配给舵机 1 的舵机功能为电机 33，舵机 2 为电机 34，舵机 3 为电机 35。这些分配对于双旋翼直升机机架的斜盘 1 "
"也相同。双旋翼直升机的斜盘 2 默认输出到舵机输出 4、5 和 6，分别分配电机 36、37 和 38。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:55
#: 0937c74e89fa4a119d02fb2eae331321
msgid ""
"For four servo swashplates, the fourth servo (Servo 5) on the single heli "
"frame defaults to servo output 5 and is assigned motor 37. For the dual heli"
" frame, the fourth servo (Servo 7) on swashplate 1 defaults to servo output "
"7 and is assigned motor 39. The fourth servo (Servo 8) on swashplate 2 "
"defaults to servo output 8 and is assigned motor 40 function."
msgstr ""
"对于四舵机斜盘，单旋翼机架上的第四个舵机（舵机 5）默认输出到舵机输出 5，分配电机 37。双旋翼机架上斜盘 1 的第四个舵机（舵机 "
"7）默认输出到舵机输出 7，分配电机 39。斜盘 2 的第四个舵机（舵机 8）默认输出到舵机输出 8，分配电机 40 功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:59
#: 47ec12391b624d758a850f0b0431af03
msgid ""
"In the case of dual heli frame with four servo swashplates, the RSCHeli "
"output function (Motor 31) will need to be assigned to another servo output "
"than its normal default of servo output 8."
msgstr "对于带有四舵机斜盘的双旋翼机架，RSCHeli 输出功能（电机 31）需要分配到除默认舵机输出 8 以外的其他舵机输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:63
#: de681747b8164e86a7dec195d81e2a3a
msgid "Swashplate Types"
msgstr "斜盘类型"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:65
#: 1fbba920f03e4e2b9033d2dcf4f70d84
msgid ""
"H3 Generic - Allows servo positions and phase angle to be set by user.  "
"Assumes all swashplate ball links are the same distance from the main shaft."
msgstr "H3 通用 - 允许用户设置舵机位置和相位角。假设所有斜盘球形连接距主轴的距离相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:68
#: dad6db3e08af489795c8f27b495da886
msgid ""
"H1 non-CCPM - Servo1 is aileron, Servo 2 is elevator and Servo 3 is "
"collective"
msgstr "H1 非 CCPM - 舵机 1 为副翼，舵机 2 为升降舵，舵机 3 为总距"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:71
#: e830be253dcb4f61bea13bf16709fef6
msgid "H3-140"
msgstr "H3-140"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:78
#: 3d53763f8246449aa4ab92d6d8cf4e32
msgid "H3-120"
msgstr "H3-120"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:84
#: 21f12b07fe5f4282b3833a70338a9753
msgid "H4-90"
msgstr "H4-90"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:90
#: 07dda07b18e849d6b6b7a11a03809422
msgid "H4-45"
msgstr "H4-45"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:96
#: 3fcd0e92cad64faebe0337f9e132de6f
msgid "Other swashplates types that can be supported"
msgstr "其他可支持的斜盘类型"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:98
#: 87da453d8b364878b6767f8b77231649
msgid ""
"H3R-140 - Use H3-140. May require "
":ref:`H_SW_COL_DIR<H_SW_COL_DIR__AP_MotorsHeli_Single>` to be reversed."
msgstr ""
"H3R-140 - 使用 H3-140。可能需要反转 "
":ref:`H_SW_COL_DIR<H_SW_COL_DIR__AP_MotorsHeli_Single>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:103
#: 754a802e3a5e4e5498a88abdcff2ac2b
msgid ""
"H3R-120 - Use H3-120. May require "
":ref:`H_SW_COL_DIR<H_SW_COL_DIR__AP_MotorsHeli_Single>` to be reversed."
msgstr ""
"H3R-120 - 使用 H3-120。可能需要反转 "
":ref:`H_SW_COL_DIR<H_SW_COL_DIR__AP_MotorsHeli_Single>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:108
#: a5251873832c4071bef6bbaf56b32031
msgid "H3-90 - Use H4-90.  Don't use one of the servo outputs."
msgstr "H3-90 - 使用 H4-90。不使用其中一个舵机输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:112
#: 18f59fab18134a73b024a93a37ded7ee
msgid "Check Proper Swashplate Movement"
msgstr "检查斜盘运动是否正确"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:114
#: ad1eb245e42c4b0784c4aa0fb45fe1b1
msgid ""
"Use your transmitter to check for proper swashplate response to cyclic and "
"collective inputs:"
msgstr "使用您的发射机检查斜盘对周期和总距输入的正确响应："

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:116
#: b0696834c59b4d8aa729a5f4d20b65ca
msgid ""
"Push forward on the elevator stick and swashplate tilts forward; pull back "
"on the elevator stick and swashplate tilts aft."
msgstr "向前推升降舵摇杆，斜盘向前倾；向后拉升降舵摇杆，斜盘向后倾。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:117
#: 0be267d3f0c54d04859337be26ed4ac2
msgid ""
"Push right on the aileron stick and the swashplate tilts right; Push left on"
" the aileron stick and the swashplate tilts left."
msgstr "向右推副翼摇杆，斜盘向右倾；向左推副翼摇杆，斜盘向左倾。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:118
#: 214ac8af22ec42bda8ce34c47a9d49e8
msgid ""
"Push up on the throttle stick (collective) and the swashplate will rise; "
"pull down on the throttle stick (collective) and the swashplate will lower."
msgstr "向上推油门摇杆（总距），斜盘上升；向下拉油门摇杆（总距），斜盘下降。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:120
#: f5578a6a288146ef954be113e8ae4402
msgid ""
"Set the :ref:`SERVO1_REVERSED <SERVO1_REVERSED>`, :ref:`SERVO2_REVERSED "
"<SERVO2_REVERSED>`, :ref:`SERVO3_REVERSED <SERVO3_REVERSED>`, and "
":ref:`H_SW_COL_DIR <H_SW_COL_DIR__AP_MotorsHeli_Single>` parameters so that "
"your swashplate responds correctly (as described above) to your collective "
"and cyclic inputs."
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`SERVO1_REVERSED <SERVO1_REVERSED>`、:ref:`SERVO2_REVERSED "
"<SERVO2_REVERSED>`、:ref:`SERVO3_REVERSED <SERVO3_REVERSED>` 和 "
":ref:`H_SW_COL_DIR <H_SW_COL_DIR__AP_MotorsHeli_Single>` "
"参数，使您的斜盘对总距和周期输入正确响应（如上所述）。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:123
#: b7381b6c6ee7446a872421290733c162
msgid "Leveling your Swashplate"
msgstr "调平您的斜盘"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:125
#: 6e9401f5516e422485a9ed8b0f4f17fe
msgid ""
"The swashplate can be leveled using either a tool specially designed to keep"
" the swashplate perpendicular to the shaft or, a less expensive way, using a"
" magnet and nail (shown below). Using the magnet and nail won’t require you "
"to remove your rotor head to level your swashplate. Rotate the shaft so the "
"nail passes over the swashplate arm.  Adjusts swashplate using one of "
"methods below so the nail touches the top of each swashplate arm."
msgstr ""
"斜盘可以使用专门设计的工具（使斜盘垂直于主轴）或更便宜的方法（使用磁铁和钉子，如下所示）来调平。使用磁铁和钉子的方法不需要拆除旋翼头来调平斜盘。转动主轴使钉子在斜盘臂上方通过。使用以下方法之一调整斜盘，使钉子接触每个斜盘臂的顶部。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:136
#: 51271830c57f431fb218ef16f9d0fe03
msgid "Leveling swashplate without using Linearize Servo Feature"
msgstr "不使用线性化舵机功能调平斜盘"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:138
#: 9a98dc860206438d9360119279a9c768
msgid ""
"If you aren’t using the Linearize Servo feature, then you will use the servo"
" trim parameters to level your swashplate. Set the :ref:`H_SV_MAN "
"<H_SV_MAN>` parameter to 1.  Adjust the transmitter throttle stick "
"(collective) until the servos are nearly perpendicular to the shaft.  Adjust"
" :ref:`SERVO1_TRIM <SERVO1_TRIM>`, :ref:`SERVO2_TRIM <SERVO2_TRIM>`, and "
":ref:`SERVO3_TRIM <SERVO3_TRIM>` until the swashplate is level."
msgstr ""
"如果不使用线性化舵机功能，则使用舵机配平参数来调平斜盘。将 :ref:`H_SV_MAN <H_SV_MAN>` 参数设为 "
"1。调整发射机油门摇杆（总距）直到舵机几乎垂直于主轴。调整 :ref:`SERVO1_TRIM "
"<SERVO1_TRIM>`、:ref:`SERVO2_TRIM <SERVO2_TRIM>` 和 :ref:`SERVO3_TRIM "
"<SERVO3_TRIM>` 直到斜盘水平。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:144
#: 370375d569364601b115e70ce88e77cd
msgid "Leveling swashplate using Linearize Servo Feature"
msgstr "使用线性化舵机功能调平斜盘"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:146
#: ce3e5211b7d74c2eabbd10cc97edda48
msgid ""
"If you intend to use Linearize Servo feature then you will have to level "
"your swashplate using the pitch links that connects swashplate to the servo."
" First though, you will set your servo so that at the midpoint of the servo "
"travel, the arm is perpendicular to the pitch link which in most cases will "
"be perpendicular to the shaft as well. If the spline on the servo control "
"horn is not allowing you to get the servo arm perpendicular to the shaft, "
"then you can use the servo trim parameters to make them perpendicular to the"
" shaft. You want the trim as close to 1500 as you can get. Now you can "
"adjust your pitch links to make the swashplate level."
msgstr ""
"如果打算使用线性化舵机功能，则必须使用连接斜盘和舵机的俯仰连杆来调平斜盘。首先，您需要设置舵机，使在舵机行程中点时，舵机臂垂直于俯仰连杆，在大多数情况下也将垂直于主轴。如果舵机控制臂上的花键不允许舵机臂垂直于主轴，则可以使用舵机配平参数使其垂直于主轴。您希望配平值尽可能接近"
" 1500。现在可以调整俯仰连杆使斜盘水平。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:158
#: e43f833473f843ab8cadbacd4c0fe0de
msgid "Collective Pitch Settings"
msgstr "总距设置"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:160
#: cffa340bc2d447c0bc2baeaeeaf8b8f4
msgid ""
"Use the servo manual setting (:ref:`H_SV_MAN <H_SV_MAN>` ) to move the "
"swashplate between min and max positions. At each position use the blade "
"pitch gauge to set the desired blade pitch.  A typical collective blade "
"pitch range is -2° to +12°. Fully aerobatic setups would use -12° to +12°. "
"For initial tests and normal autonomous operation, the narrower range is "
"recommended. See :ref:`traditional-helicopter-aerobatic-setup` for more "
"information about aerobatic setup."
msgstr ""
"使用舵机手动设置（:ref:`H_SV_MAN "
"<H_SV_MAN>`）在最小和最大位置之间移动斜盘。在每个位置使用桨叶螺距规设置期望的桨叶螺距。典型的总距桨叶螺距范围为 -2° 到 "
"+12°。全特技设置使用 -12° 到 +12°。初始测试和正常自主操作建议使用较窄的范围。有关特技设置的更多信息，请参见 "
":ref:`traditional-helicopter-aerobatic-setup`。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:164
#: 852ce53de9fe49658e848dd3fc38aaed
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`H_SV_MAN <H_SV_MAN>` to 2 to have swashplate move to maximum "
"position.  Adjust :ref:`H_COL_MAX <H_COL_MAX>` until blade pitch angle "
"measures the desired maximum collective blade pitch."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`H_SV_MAN <H_SV_MAN>` 设为 2，使斜盘移动到最大位置。调整 :ref:`H_COL_MAX <H_COL_MAX>`"
" 直到桨叶螺距角测量值达到期望的最大总距桨叶螺距。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:167
#: 3701d0c0a7fb41dba4ce76b6b06e8e7f
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`H_SV_MAN <H_SV_MAN>` to 4 to have swashplate move to minimum "
"position.  Adjust :ref:`H_COL_MIN <H_COL_MIN>` until blade pitch angle "
"measures the desired minimum collective blade pitch."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`H_SV_MAN <H_SV_MAN>` 设为 4，使斜盘移动到最小位置。调整 :ref:`H_COL_MIN <H_COL_MIN>`"
" 直到桨叶螺距角测量值达到期望的最小总距桨叶螺距。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:170
#: 6ac9ccaee72c46aeaf2d9995ed5f8012
msgid ""
"Overall collective measurements must be made using the :ref:`H_SV_MAN "
"<H_SV_MAN>` parameter since these would be impacted and inaccurate if the "
"autopilot stabilization was active."
msgstr ""
"总体总距测量必须使用 :ref:`H_SV_MAN <H_SV_MAN>` 参数进行，因为如果飞控稳定系统处于激活状态，这些测量将受到影响并不准确。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:173
#: 532caa73cef940c39afccec351b162e2
msgid "Minimum and Maximum Collective Blade Pitch Angle"
msgstr "最小和最大总距桨叶螺距角"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:175
#: ad4a6490942c4e05af0bc598c84dd6c2
msgid ""
"For :ref:`H_COL_ANG_MAX <H_COL_ANG_MAX>`, enter the maximum collective blade"
" pitch angle in degrees that corresponds to :ref:`H_COL_MAX <H_COL_MAX>`.  "
"For :ref:`H_COL_ANG_MIN <H_COL_ANG_MIN>`, enter the minimum collective blade"
" pitch angle in degrees that corresponds to :ref:`H_COL_MIN <H_COL_MIN>`."
msgstr ""
"对于 :ref:`H_COL_ANG_MAX <H_COL_ANG_MAX>`，输入对应 :ref:`H_COL_MAX <H_COL_MAX>` "
"的最大总距桨叶螺距角（度）。对于 :ref:`H_COL_ANG_MIN <H_COL_ANG_MIN>`，输入对应 :ref:`H_COL_MIN "
"<H_COL_MIN>` 的最小总距桨叶螺距角（度）。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:178
#: 0a99e2bf261f46b18b7e62e619e7f693
msgid "Zero Thrust Point"
msgstr "零推力点"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:180
#: fb6ced8e74444579a37aee6a63cb4d17
msgid ""
":ref:`H_COL_ZERO_THRST <H_COL_ZERO_THRST>` is the collective blade pitch "
"angle in degrees for zero thrust.  The collective blade pitch that "
"corresponds to zero thrust is used to set the mixing of collective to yaw.  "
"This will be zero degrees collective blade pitch angle for symmetric blades."
" Set the servo manual setting :ref:`H_SV_MAN <H_SV_MAN>` to 3 to have "
"swashplate move to zero thrust position and verify the collective blade "
"pitch corresponds the pitch angle set for :ref:`H_COL_ZERO_THRST "
"<H_COL_ZERO_THRST>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`H_COL_ZERO_THRST <H_COL_ZERO_THRST>` "
"是零推力时的总距桨叶螺距角（度）。对应零推力的总距桨叶螺距用于设置总距到偏航的混控。对于对称桨叶，这将是零度总距桨叶螺距角。将舵机手动设置 "
":ref:`H_SV_MAN <H_SV_MAN>` 设为 3，使斜盘移动到零推力位置，并验证总距桨叶螺距是否对应为 "
":ref:`H_COL_ZERO_THRST <H_COL_ZERO_THRST>` 设定的螺距角。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:183
#: 53eeba84b63c48f083e61ec6e5853066
msgid "Minimum Landed Collective"
msgstr "最小落地总距"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:185
#: 6c984a4d319149269ac6dc81b73452b5
msgid ""
"The :ref:`H_COL_LAND_MIN <H_COL_LAND_MIN>` parameter is used as the lower "
"collective pitch limit in degrees for modes that use altitude hold in the "
"vertical axis.  This keeps the autopilot from driving collective too low "
"resulting in ground resonance and is also used to detect landing in these "
"modes. The default angle for :ref:`H_COL_LAND_MIN <H_COL_LAND_MIN>` "
"parameter is set to -2 degrees collective blade pitch angle and would allow "
"symmetrical blade equipped vehicles to descend at a reasonable rate, yet "
"avoid being too negative on the ground.  If you have non-symmetrical blades,"
" then set it to a blade pitch that is lower by the amount used as the zero "
"thrust pitch angle.  For example, if the :ref:`H_COL_ZERO_THRST "
"<H_COL_ZERO_THRST>` is determined to be -3 deg then :ref:`H_COL_LAND_MIN "
"<H_COL_LAND_MIN>` should be set to -5 degrees."
msgstr ""
":ref:`H_COL_LAND_MIN <H_COL_LAND_MIN>` "
"参数用作在垂直轴使用高度保持模式时的总距螺距下限（度）。这可防止飞控将总距驱动得过低，导致地面共振，也用于在这些模式下检测降落。:ref:`H_COL_LAND_MIN"
" <H_COL_LAND_MIN>` 参数的默认角度设置为 -2 "
"度总距桨叶螺距角，允许配备对称桨叶的飞行器以合理速率下降，同时避免在地面上过于负值。如果您使用非对称桨叶，则将其设置为比零推力螺距角低相应量的桨叶螺距。例如，如果确定"
" :ref:`H_COL_ZERO_THRST <H_COL_ZERO_THRST>` 为 -3 度，则 :ref:`H_COL_LAND_MIN "
"<H_COL_LAND_MIN>` 应设为 -5 度。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:187
#: c85cecc2294e400688fe7bf959ff7e51
msgid ""
"The default value for this parameter should be low enough to protect most "
"helicopters from in-flight disarm during autonomous flight due to false "
"landing detections.  This most likely will occur in conditions where the "
"aircraft experiences updrafts in hover or during landing phases of flight "
"which causes the collective to decrease below this parameter value.  "
"Acrobatic helicopter setups or heli's using non-symmetric blades should "
"consider lowering this value."
msgstr ""
"此参数的默认值应足够低，以保护大多数直升机在自主飞行期间因错误的降落检测导致飞行中解锁。这最有可能发生在飞行器在悬停或降落阶段遇到上升气流的情况下，导致总距降低到此参数值以下。特技直升机设置或使用非对称桨叶的直升机应考虑降低此值。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:190
#: d3a32fbe36c6488794f7d06e6ccebcd8
