msgid ""
"ArduPilot provides a programmable curve for STABILIZE mode to allow "
"\"softening\" of the curve to provide smoother pilot control. This curve is "
"set by the ``IM_STB_COL_x`` parameters as shown in the graph below. All "
"other modes use the collective extremes and a straight line curve that were "
"setup above."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 为 Stabilize 模式提供可编程曲线，允许曲线\"软化\"以提供更平滑的飞手控制。此曲线由 ``IM_STB_COL_x`` "
"参数设置，如下图所示。所有其他模式使用上面设置的总距极值和直线曲线。"

