#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:209
#: 0ca953f90f144f61a6af8f603694c297
msgid "Setting Maximum Cyclic Pitch"
msgstr "设置最大周期螺距"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:211
#: e781a78430a84e999291c055f275065f
msgid ""
"The parameter :ref:`H_CYC_MAX <H_CYC_MAX>` sets the maximum cyclic blade "
"pitch. Checking the maximum cyclic blade pitch requires positioning the "
"blades 90 deg to the axis that is being measured. Therefore if the "
"longitudinal maximum blade cyclic pitch is being measured then rotate the "
"blades until they are perpendicular to the fuselage of the aircraft "
"(sticking out the left and right side).  Measure the blade pitch with the "
"elevator and aileron stick centered and then deflect the elevator stick full"
" forward or aft and measure the blade pitch.  The difference between the two"
" measurements would be the maximum cyclic blade pitch corresponding to the "
":ref:`H_CYC_MAX <H_CYC_MAX>`.  The cyclic blade pitch is the same for the "
"pitch (elevator) and roll (aileron) axes."
msgstr ""
"参数 :ref:`H_CYC_MAX <H_CYC_MAX>` 设置最大周期桨叶螺距。检查最大周期桨叶螺距需要将桨叶定位到被测轴的 90 "
"度位置。因此，如果正在测量纵向最大桨叶周期螺距，则旋转桨叶直到它们垂直于飞行器机身（向左右两侧伸出）。在升降舵和副翼摇杆居中时测量桨叶螺距，然后将升降舵摇杆完全向前或向后偏转并测量桨叶螺距。两次测量之间的差值即为对应"
" :ref:`H_CYC_MAX <H_CYC_MAX>` 的最大周期桨叶螺距。俯仰（升降舵）和横滚（副翼）轴的周期桨叶螺距相同。"
